@startuml sequence_review_scrub
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Daily Results - Review scrub

actor User
participant "Scrubber" as Sc
participant "TileContext" as Ctx
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C
participant "API" as API
participant "Cache" as Ca

User -> Sc: Drag to 2026-04-15
Sc -> Ctx: selectedReviewDate(date) [debounced]
Ctx -> T: signal change
T -> C: load('review', '2026-04-15T...')
C -> Ca: GET /commitment/daily-results?asOf=...
alt cache hit
  Ca --> C: 200
else miss
  C -> API: GET /commitment/daily-results?asOf=...
  API -> API: clamp asOf, count
  API --> C: { completed:5, total:9 } + Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
  C -> Ca: store
end
C --> T: signal updates
T --> User: 5 / 9 with REVIEW pill

@enduml
